The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Manta Ray''' is {{Green|500}}, resulting in a catch chance of {{Chance|5%|1|20|sea creatures}} in [[Sea Creatures#Hotspot|Hotspot Sea Creatures]] pool. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

